# Scratch queue rows FSD (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/FSD.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title Farmer's Structures donor (farmers_structures.md section 5)
@@phase worldgen
@@jars creativecommon
@@prep B: boot=2: fresh
@@prep B: boot=2: run rm -f farmers_upstream && mkdir farmers_upstream
@@text
@@text Needs patcherMod rebuilt and installed (`:creativeCommon:installToMods`), the Creative Delight jar (hanging canvas sign), and `farmers_upstream/FarmersStructures-1.0.6-1.21.1_neoforge.jar` in the game folder.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-FSD-01
@group B
@commands Boot a server; read `logs/latest.log`
@pass One `[farmers-donor] N files from Farmer's Structures 1.0.6 {...}` line; no `Could not translate`; the counts list `blocks mapped minecraft:pink_petals`, no `blocks to air` for a block you expect to exist (rope fence, gleaming salad, hanging canvas sign, basket)
@fails Depends on: donor jar
@reviewed 2026-11-26
bootexpect \[farmers-donor\] [0-9]+ files from Farmer's Structures 1\.0\.6
bootreject Could not translate
bootexpect blocks mapped minecraft:pink_petals=[0-9]+
bootreject blocks to air \S*(rope_fence|gleaming|hanging_canvas|basket)
shell grep -hE "\[farmers-donor\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-300 | head -3
## SQ-FSD-03
@group B
@commands `/place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod` a few times (different spots)
@pass Pond places; fish are cod in some, with pike and perch in others; no empty pond
@fails Depends on: Upgrade Aquatic
@reviewed 2026-11-26
@absent farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod (structures the Farmer's Structures donor pack adds at load, registered after the last /dumpall)
> forceload add 2000 2000 2320 2060
sleep 60
> place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod 2040 70 2030
waitlog Generated structure "farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod" 90
> place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod 2160 70 2030
waitlog Generated structure "farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod" 90
> place structure farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod 2280 70 2030
waitlog Generated structure "farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod" 90
count Generated structure "farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod" == 3
> cdevtest entities 2040 70 2030 40
> cdevtest entities 2160 70 2030 40
> cdevtest entities 2280 70 2030 40
sleep 3
reject Failed to place structure
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the three entities lines: cod in some ponds, pike and perch (Upgrade Aquatic) in others, none empty; no "Empty or non-existent pool" for farmers_structures
