## SQ-FSD-07 | structure groups: Farmer's sets in group remote, no carp (queue group B: registry only)
@group B
@commands Dump with `/dumpall`; look at `structure_set` for `farmers_structures:*`
@pass Group `remote` holds cod, cacaos, fishs_stew, ratatouilles, shepherd_farms, squids; no `aquacultures_carp`
@fails
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): the group set moved to the Worldgen namespace (creativeworldgen:group/remote, structuregen.json)
> dumpstructuregen
waitlog structuregen\.json 300
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py sset creativeworldgen:group/remote +farmers_structures:aquacultures_cod +farmers_structures:cacaos +farmers_structures:fishs_stew +farmers_structures:ratatouilles +farmers_structures:shepherd_farms +farmers_structures:squids -farmers_structures:aquacultures_carp
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py sset any -farmers_structures:aquacultures_carp

## SQ-FSD-08 | cook_end_1_21 template has the hanging canvas sign (200 -60 540)
@group B
@commands Look at the cook house piece with a hanging canvas sign (`cook_end_1_21`, via `/cdevplace` or many cooks)
@pass The sign is present, hanging from a ceiling
@fails Depends on: CD jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): own forceload over the template box (W unloaded)
> forceload add 192 528 239 575
sleep 10
> place template farmers_structures:cook_houses/cook_end_1_21 200 -60 540
expect Loaded template
> cdevtest count 195 -64 535 235 -30 575 farmersdelight:hanging_canvas_sign
expect verb=count block=farmersdelight:hanging_canvas_sign n=[1-9]
> forceload remove 192 528 239 575
look the sign hangs under a block (the count line's on= lists what is under it: air under a hanging sign is expected; the ceiling is the block above)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

## SQ-FSD-02 | no donor jar: one warning, the game loads on Farmer's Structures 1.0.0 data
@group B
@commands Rename the donor jar, boot
@pass One warning that it is missing; the game loads with the 1.0.0 structures only
@fails Depends on: donor jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A2.qb
@boot 2
@absent farmers_structures:cooks (structure id: listed in kubejs/exported/structures.json worldgen, not in the registry dump)
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): boot 2 of the step on a fresh world, section @@prep makes srv/farmers_upstream an empty folder
# (the step booted with the donor in place); the forceload now covers the place spot (it was 96 96 127 127)
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect is missing: Farmer's Structures runs on its installed 1\.0\.0 data
bootreject \[farmers-donor\] \d+ files from Farmer's Structures 1\.0\.6
shell n=$(grep -c "is missing: Farmer's Structures runs on its installed 1.0.0 data" logs/latest.log); echo "warnings: $n"; [ "$n" -eq 1 ]
> forceload add 208 568 271 631
sleep 20
> place structure farmers_structures:cooks 240 -60 600
sleep 5
> forceload remove 208 568 271 631
look the cook house places (1.0.0 pieces only; any "Empty or non-existent pool" line names a 1.0.6 piece)
